    "content": {
      "snl": "def(AlgebraicGeometry.RealProjectivePlane,Type,Quotient[default](Set.Elem[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$),Set.diff[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$),Set.univ[typed](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$)),Set.singleton[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$),LA.Zero[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$))))),AlgebraicGeometry.RealProjectivePlane.Proportional))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "The **real projective plane** is the quotient $\\mathbb{P}^2_{\\mathbb{R}}=(\\mathbb{R}^3\\setminus\\{0\\})/{\\sim}$ of the nonzero triples by the proportionality relation. Equivalently, its points are the lines of $\\mathbb{R}^3$ through the origin, and also the ratios $X:Y:Z$.",
          "zh-CN": "**实射影平面**是非零三元组按同比例关系作商所得的商集 $\\mathbb{P}^2_{\\mathbb{R}}=(\\mathbb{R}^3\\setminus\\{0\\})/{\\sim}$。等价地，它的点是 $\\mathbb{R}^3$ 中过原点的直线，也是比 $X:Y:Z$。"
        }
      }
